  "contentHtml": "<h3 id=\"block-afb8db23e6484370ae9eeedda27e83a5\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Le Domaine d’Ahinvaux est divisé en plusieurs espaces, dont le verger conservatoire implanté entre 2005 et 2015. On y trouve de nombreuses variétés de pommiers, poiriers et pruniers de conservation.</h3><h1 id=\"block-17495d4b499141b4bdbeae71e96d2433\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">La palette végétale 🍃</h1><p id=\"block-614e7c3fb367453cbb16da73ca7d1a8c\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">En cliquant sur le lien ci-dessous, tu accèdes à la liste des plantations gérée par le collectif <a href=\"https://www.semisto.org\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"https://www.semisto.org\">Semisto</a>. Chaque plantation est répertoriée et un suivi est organisé.</p><p id=\"block-737a08a3e24f49ea839dbd39652a8d2c\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><strong><a href=\"https://les4sources.semisto.org\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"https://les4sources.semisto.org\">La palette végétale du Domaine d’Ahinvaux</a></strong></p><h1 id=\"block-c57c0c9e1b4b476da2b34b26ce13f932\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Au verger conservatoire 🍎</h1><p id=\"block-b7201df5ba9947b6b80d016b1fed62a7\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Un verger de pommiers, poiriers et pruniers sur 75 ares en bordure de forêt, longé par le sentier de randonnée menant à la ferme de Venatte.</p><div id=\"block-2883c62d2f174ac2b1d163aca26c921c\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/1032b63f-5892-4582-a107-5a87e60eeec2/dji_fly_20240825_142334_973_1724589555431_photo_optimized/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/1032b63f-5892-4582-a107-5a87e60eeec2/dji_fly_20240825_142334_973_1724589555431_photo_optimized/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/1032b63f-5892-4582-a107-5a87e60eeec2/dji_fly_20240825_142334_973_1724589555431_photo_optimized/public\"></span></div><div id=\"block-3c6db4ede30d49e3b762093a18dbbd0f\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/01fc3bc3-5c0e-4159-b87f-3a0507034453/dji_fly_20240825_142602_979_1724589528208_photo_optimized/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/01fc3bc3-5c0e-4159-b87f-3a0507034453/dji_fly_20240825_142602_979_1724589528208_photo_optimized/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/01fc3bc3-5c0e-4159-b87f-3a0507034453/dji_fly_20240825_142602_979_1724589528208_photo_optimized/public\"></span></div><h1 id=\"block-c54c6977f7744000ba1c9d2e19b9b5fd\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Au jardin-forêt 🌲</h1><p id=\"block-e0eeeeff73524108b3aefc08f9698328\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Un espace ressourçant parsemé d’arbres fruitiers basse tige et mi-tige, de nombreux petits fruits (cassis, groseilliers et groseilliers à maquereaux), 3 jeunes chataigniers, un abricotier, de jeunes kiwaïs, les poules marans et Shiny le coq.</p><div id=\"block-5f5269dad3cb444d90735f2151d87859\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/e9176d82-98c9-41ac-a029-096ac7520978/dji_fly_20240825_143116_995_1724589470432_photo_optimized/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/e9176d82-98c9-41ac-a029-096ac7520978/dji_fly_20240825_143116_995_1724589470432_photo_optimized/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/e9176d82-98c9-41ac-a029-096ac7520978/dji_fly_20240825_143116_995_1724589470432_photo_optimized/public\"></span></div><div id=\"block-b04aa37a91364f419156e6a3a215b911\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/afc8e60a-667f-4dbd-8d78-beb29b5b2386/dji_fly_20240825_143154_996_1724589465821_photo_optimized/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/afc8e60a-667f-4dbd-8d78-beb29b5b2386/dji_fly_20240825_143154_996_1724589465821_photo_optimized/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/afc8e60a-667f-4dbd-8d78-beb29b5b2386/dji_fly_20240825_143154_996_1724589465821_photo_optimized/public\"></span></div><h1 id=\"block-2870d149331780f4833ac3b19151c2bd\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Le jus des 4 Sources🧃</h1><p id=\"block-2870d149331780c099eee307bdf441bb\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Saviez-vous que de toutes ces pommes récoltées, nous en faisions du jus ? En cubis ou en bouteilles, retrouvez notre production à l’épicerie !</p><div id=\"block-2870d14933178074b013d9708a0951e8\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/5996eb72-9ca6-40d7-a3a7-d4308ac5c5a2/e099bd41-d607-40e1-bce6-6e931bf06e6e/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/5996eb72-9ca6-40d7-a3a7-d4308ac5c5a2/e099bd41-d607-40e1-bce6-6e931bf06e6e/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/5996eb72-9ca6-40d7-a3a7-d4308ac5c5a2/e099bd41-d607-40e1-bce6-6e931bf06e6e/public\"></span></div>",
